But he hasn't even come out with it yet. I tell him I think it'll be another year before the film is finished and he says, Okay, I'll take a mordinko. But it's already been five. Another guy chimed in and says, Coastist didn't win the lottery, but he's done quite well for himself. He says he's been getting paid for all the television interviews he's done.
但他甚至还没把它拿出来。我告诉他，我想电影完成还需要一年，他说，好吧，我会再等一会儿。但已经五年了。另一个人插话说，科斯蒂斯没中彩票，但他自己做得相当不错。他说他从他做的所有电视采访中都得到了报酬。

